By "someone" you mean Rodney, and if you do enough damage to him he
won't have time to steal the Staff (since he has to steal the amulet
first).  If he does steal it, just zap him with a wand of death.  The
Staff is such an effective weapon against Rodney that you'll only need
the wand if he steals the Staff, so you can save your charges for that
situation.  If you must use a backup weapon, any ascension kit
contains a unicorn horn (it's usually what I'm wielding right before I
complete the quest).
Yes, the PYEC is a great item, but with a little luck a healer can get
it much earlier in the game than a tourist could.

Even as a pacifist I've been able to recover the Staff by putting
Rodney between me and a black dragon.


